    "created_at": "2024-06-21T18:19:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-06-21T18:19:04Z",
    "body": "> The [button layout magic](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#button-layout-2) covers more than safe centering, do you intend to keep those as-is or try to remove them also?\r\n\r\n@zcorpan - Blink M126 just rolled out with block-layout buttons enabled by default. And we didn't include the anonymous block described by that part of the spec. (I suspect this was added just for centering purposes, but you really don't need it). So I intend to remove that also.\r\n\r\nI'll prepare a PR so we can see what this looks like.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
