    "updated_at": "2024-06-22T00:36:58Z",
    "body": "My understanding is that [the way blink implemented this](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/core/html/resources/html.css;l=417;drc=f179d41d5d064d852f5415f89e757004ce8f14b7) doesn't affect grid or flex, which is a bit unfortunate because it's replacing some magic for another.\r\n\r\n@bfgeek is the idea to eventually apply this to all buttons as proposed in your comment? Or something else?",
